  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "I got sent a program for the Minelab CTX 3030 and told it would detect deeper and find me more than what i usually do.."
  },
  {
   "t": "h3",
   "html": "Ok ill give it a go nothing to loose have i?",
   "inferred": true
  },
  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Not putting a downer on anything but when somebody says their program is deeper and finds more ask yourself will it work on where i detect, well the answer was simple no it wont, finds rate went down, so if you make your own programs stick with what works for you"
  }
